# Data: track martyrs.json/xlsx, photos/, overrides.json — exclude intermediates.
# NOTE: the ~765 SELECTED cover frames (one per published martyr, listed in
# martyrs.json's featured_frame_path) are force-added into git by
# scripts/stage_covers.ps1 so GitHub Pages can serve the detail-page cover;
# the rest of data/frames/ (raw intermediate card frames) stays ignored here.
data/frames/
data/state.json
data/missing_birth.log
# AI date-verification batch work-files (scripts/ai_verify.py) — the DB and
# docs/ai-verify-report-*.md are the durable record, not these scratch JSONs.
data/ai_batches/

# Local-only email notification settings (Gmail app password) — NEVER commit.
data/notify_settings.json

# Generated by scripts/setup_2hourly_trigger.ps1 — contains machine-specific absolute paths
scripts/_run_phase3_silent.bat
scripts/_run_nightly_silent.vbs
